# Framework distribution contents.
#
# The bundled workflow-plugin projects live in ucagent/plugins/. Only UnitTest
# ships with the framework (via package-data in pyproject.toml); the other
# projects and all plugin test suites stay source-tree only and are distributed
# as their own packages.
prune ucagent/plugins/Formal
prune ucagent/plugins/DesignWithPPA
prune ucagent/plugins/RTL2Spec
prune ucagent/plugins/ACT4
prune ucagent/plugins/UnitTest/tests
